EnOcean Direct integration for Home Assistant
Copyright 2026 Michael Villeprat

This product depends on enocean-async (https://github.com/henningkerstan/enocean-async),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It is used as a library dependency; no source
is vendored into this repository.

EnOcean Equipment Profile (EEP) field layouts for D5-00-01, F6-02-01, F6-02-02 and
D2-01-0F were independently transcribed from the publicly available EnOcean Alliance
EEP specification. No third-party EEP database is distributed with this project.

The projects listed below were studied as behavioural references only; no code was
copied from them:
- home-assistant/core enocean integration (Apache-2.0)
- szymkiewiczmathieu/ha_enocean_custom (Apache-2.0)
- ChristopheHD/HA_enoceanmqtt-addon and overlay (GPL-3.0)
- ESDN83/HA_enoceanmqtt-addon-ui (MIT)
- NextDom/plugin-enocean (GPL family)
